OL,3,GNEWSARow continues over #140m loan to
OL,4,Acity centre developer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA long-running legal battle over public
OL,7,Floans worth #140m made by Greater
OL,8,FManchester Combined Authority (GMCA) to
OL,9,Fa city centre developer could be
OL,10,Fheading to the Supreme Court.
OL,12,FLandowner Aubrey Weis has applied for
OL,13,Fpermission to appeal against the GMCA
OL,14,Fin the ongoing dispute over loans to
OL,15,Fso-called "special purpose vehicles" -
OL,16,Fcompanies set up to deliver specific
OL,17,Fdevelopment projects - linked to
OL,18,FRenaker founder Daren Whitaker.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
