OL,3,GNEWSARow continues over #140m loan to
OL,4,Acity centre developer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe application follows attempts to
OL,7,Foverturn the earlier ruling in hearings
OL,8,Fto the Competition Appeal Tribunal and
OL,9,Fthe Court of Appeal.
OL,11,FWeis's lawyers claim the loans were
OL,12,Funfair subsidies, but the Court of
OL,13,FAppeal ruling in June found there had
OL,14,Fbeen "no error of law" in the GMCA's
OL,15,Fdecision to provide them.
